# Append-only telemetry. Concurrent scan cycles (and the nightly scorecard)
# append to the same day's log, and the correct resolution is the UNION of
# both sides -- never one side winning, which silently drops observations.
# Without this, a rebase conflict on 2026-08-27T23:07Z wedged the retry loop
# and cost the tail of that day's collection.
#
# Deliberately NOT applied to docs/*.json: a union merge of JSON produces a
# broken file. Those are deterministic regenerations from logs/, so losing a
# race there is repaired by the next cycle.
logs/*.jsonl merge=union
